p>This bill requires businesses to allow a customer to use a nonpublic restroom if the customer has an eligible medical condition (e.g., inflammatory bowel disease) that requires immediate access to a restroom and other conditions are met. The Department of Labor must establish a system of identification cards for customers with eligible medical conditions to present to businesses.</p>","updateDate":"2026-10-16T15:48:44Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Restroom Access Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-10-16T15:49:12Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-10-16T15:49:12Z"}
